 "purpose": "registered confirmation of the default as a user runs it with control variables: the plain fevc command (joint nuisance, rule share > 0.10) after the first-order term for estimated control coefficients, on the release-candidate source and its qualified macOS arm64 plugin. The twenty design shapes, the replications and the tolerances are those of conf2; the design seeds and the run seed are new. Every design carries controls (kinds and assignment rule in make_conf3_spec.py): one control correlated with both effects, that control with a second one, one control unrelated to the effects, one control loaded on the worker effect; controls loaded on the firm effect only in designs without a block gap. Not covered by design: a control index as large as the effects, error variances that move with a control inside a cell, a control loaded on the firm effect where the blocks differ.",
